(   - Present Simple for overarching scientific claims, models, and general conclusions: "These) Tj
T*
(   data demonstrate that phosphorylation activates kinase activity".) Tj
T*
(   - Past Simple when comparing current results with historical trials: "Our observed binding) Tj
T*
(   affinity was higher than the value reported by Jones \(2020\)".) Tj
