(   3. The Rare Legitimate Exception \(Temporary Dynamic Process\):) Tj
T*
(   Some stative verbs shift to dynamic meaning when indicating temporary, active changes:) Tj
T*
(   - "The optical density is increasing rapidly" \(Dynamic change of state\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
