12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze tense harmony in complex sentences containing adverbial time clauses \('after', 'before', 'until', 'as soon as'\).) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Temporal Anchor Principle:) Tj
T*
(   In complex sentences where an independent clause is modified by an adverbial time clause, the) Tj
